{"resourceIdentifier":"318","resourceName":"Clinton Landfill Gas Collection and Combustion Project","description":"The project activity is the capture and destruction of methane from the Clinton Landfill via combustion engines. The generated electricity is sold to the local grid. However, the displacement of fossil fuels resulting from this activity is not included in this Project and emission reductions from the offsite use of electricity are not addressed in this project.  The project includes an active landfill gas collection system including wells, piping, blowers, meters and valves; a back-up open flare; two 1.6-MW Caterpillar 3520C engine generator sets; gas conditioning equipment; a building to house the generators; and associated interconnection and metering devices.  This project creates voluntary emissions reductions over and above those achieved by the gas collection system in the baseline scenario","location":{"latitude":40.100000,"longitude":-88.957999},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":null,"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"318"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"IL"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"3Degrees Group, Inc"},{"type":"string","value":"Luanda, United States"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Registered"},{"type":"assetSearchLink","value":null,"targetId":"318"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"93520"}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Waste handling and disposal"}]},{"code":"PROTOCOL_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"ACM0001"}]},{"code":"VALIDATOR_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Carbon Check (India) Private Ltd."}]},{"code":"PROJECT_REGISTRATION_DATE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"15/02/2022"}]},{"code":"CREDIT_PERIOD_INFO","val